OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds in Special Olympics GB
OL,4,Anational games
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 1,200 athletes are limbering up
OL,7,Fto go head-to-head at the Special
OL,8,FOlympics Great Britain National Summer
OL,9,FGames in the West Midlands.
OL,11,FTaking place for the first time since
OL,12,F2017, the games' 21-day, 15-sport
OL,13,Fprogramme culminates in the region
OL,14,Fstaging events between Thursday and
OL,15,FSunday, including at Birmingham's
OL,16,FAlexander Stadium.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
