OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds in Special Olympics GB
OL,4,Anational games
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester rapper Aitch - a
OL,7,Flongstanding champion of inclusion
OL,8,Finspired by his younger sister who has
OL,9,FDown's syndrome - would be the headline
OL,10,Fperformer on the opening night,
OL,11,Forganisers said.
OL,13,FKatie Day, from Birmingham, who will
OL,14,Fcompete in the swimming, will
OL,15,Fofficially open the games with athlete
OL,16,FGreg Silvester of Wolverhampton.
